- Did not explore how mental model learning processes differ for self vs. other; only examined model use, not model acquisition;
- Dual-system MB/MF distinction may not capture the full spectrum of strategies, especially under high decision noise for others;
- Mechanisms underlying SVO–MB link are speculative (inequality aversion vs. cognitive control accounts not disentangled);
