- {"name": "Model 4 (Eq. 6, Imitation)", "family": "Imitation", "n_params": 2, "metric": "LAME/BMS exceedance probability"}
  - Empathy(t) = Empathy(t0) + k * R(t). Params: k, (alpha for prediction stage).

